般拉麵店的間距還要窄，吃東西確實很有壓迫感，也可能因為我背了個包包，走道也是很窄，有客人進來的時候會碰到我的椅背。\n餐點部分豚骨拉麵我點了麵體偏硬，結果整碗還是軟軟的，不知道是煮麵的沒注意，還是他們麵體比較細，麵體我很不喜歡。\n湯的部分是整碗拉麵的重點，這部分中規中矩，不過奶味稍微重，也不知道是加鮮奶還是…..？\n配菜的部分有一根玉米筍跟一小朵花椰菜，不是木耳或筍乾流派，半顆蛋拿捏熟度掌握的很好，吃的出來是冰的蛋放進去被湯給加熱。\n豬叉燒的話口味比較清淡，沒有特別好吃。雞叉燒的話，不如豬，吃起來就是舒肥雞胸。\n唐揚雞真的一般般，不需要特別點。\n最後是飲料，可能因為冷泡的關係，沒什麼茶味的櫻花煎茶。\n最後，其他間拉麵店，可以免費加麵，但是這邊要加錢。",null,[0,154]]]],[null,1686108785000000,1686108785000000,"3 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04RzZxY0RMaFZrZl9weEFBN3NZUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQm04RzZxY0RMaFZrZl9weEFBN3NZURoTQ2d3SThmVF9vd1lROHFHdDBnTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjO0PXXytKWAxXog68BHe47GmEQ_2MIjwEoCQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjRNbTlNTVZwUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjRNbTlNTVZwUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjRNbTlNTVZwUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjRNbTlNTVZwUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjRNbTlNTVZwUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjRNbTlNTVZwUkVBRRAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝您的建議跟分享，您提到的問題我們已經在内部\n進行討論跟改進，十分感謝您的建議及回饋，希望不久的將來能再給我們一次服務您的機會，謝謝您。",null,[0,69]]]],[null,null,13619,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4Mm9MMVpREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xeeae59774017ae1d!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDx2oL1ZQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4Mm9MMVpR