cHCKMBKAk",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjO0PXXytKWAxXog68BHe47GmEQ3IcHCKQBKAo",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjO0PXXytKWAxXog68BHe47GmEQ3IcHCKUBKAs",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["平價拉麵店，有令人驚艷的品項。特別推薦炸雞與辣醬。\n\n🍜招牌豚骨拉麵：蔥花、筍乾、玉米筍、溏心蛋，搭配豬雞繁盛（多叉燒）。表現中規中矩。湯頭沒有太深刻的印象。豬叉燒也還行。雞叉燒味道偏淡。\n🍜川味炙燒牛拉麵：麻辣湯頭，搭配蔥花泥、筍乾、花椰菜。湯頭深厚、香氣多層次，挺涮嘴的。牛肉片炙燒並有黑胡椒，有點嚼勁、算美味，但是跟整碗麵有點搭配不起來。\n🍜配料：玉米筍和花椰菜雖然罕見，但也沒太特別之處。溏心蛋熟度恰好、有入味，不錯！\n🧂其他：可自取涼檸檬水。特別推薦他們的獨家辣醬，香味豐富、加入湯頭內可以直接提升一整個檔次！！來吃麵一定要加上一匙體驗看看。\n🍗招牌唐揚雞：真的是招牌。外酥內嫩，多汁入味，回味再三，印象甚至超越了拉麵。會考慮專程來吃的美味程度。\n🥬腐乳泡菜：小小一份，但是味道濃厚、清脆爽口！配著拉麵吃真的頗有解膩效果，很愉快。\n\n店面不大、環境整潔明亮、店員親切有禮，支援LINE pay. 整體來說挺推薦。用餐時段不免會需要排隊，建議挑早點或晚點再來喔。",null,[0,94]]]],[null,1693090477000000,1693090477000000,"3 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04SjJUOFAzTjVrNm9LdEFBY2h2QQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQm04SjJUOFAzTjVrNm9LdEFBY2h2QRoTQ2d3SXJZV3Fwd1lRZ18zdTNnRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjO0PXXytKWAxXog68BHe47GmEQ_2MIpgEoDA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndNV1p5TFhCM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndNV1p5TFhCM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndNV1p5TFhCM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndNV1p5TFhCM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10380566395348775009/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUndNV1p5TFhCM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,nul